  "description": "Da-Won is your average college freshman-- except that she can see ghosts. All she wants is a normal life, and maybe a little spice of love. But when she runs into the all-too-handsome Da-Ham, president of the occult club, her life turns upside down. From fortune-telling to investigating urban legends, Da-Won can't shake the feeling that there's more to Da-Ham than he's letting on. Is this destiny or something far more sinister? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
